# beflow control-plane AGENTOWNERS
#
# Each non-comment line is:  <path-glob>  <decision>  [agent]
#   decision = block | require_approval | allow   (most-restrictive wins)
#   agent    = optional; restrict the rule to one agent by name
#
# This file is empty by default — beflow imposes no approval policy you didn't
# write. With no rules every change is allowed; add rules to gate paths. Examples:
#
#   tests/**     require_approval     # changes to tests need a human sign-off
#   .github/**   require_approval     # CI/workflow changes need a human sign-off
#   migrations/** block               # never let an agent touch DB migrations
#   src/**       allow  claude        # claude may freely change src/**
